llama.cpp
------------------------------------------
LLM inference in C/C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libggml-devel-0.29.0-1bl3
  libggml0-0.29.0-1bl3
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libllama-devel-0.9.0-1bl1
  libllama0-0.9.0-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libggml-devel-0.29.0-1bl3
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python312-jinja2-3.1.6-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack llama.cpp-0.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./llama.cpp-0.9.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/llama.cpp-0.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/llama.cpp-0.9.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libllama0-0.9.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libllama-devel-0.9.0-X.tar.xz

